@@ -217,6 +217,21 @@ Example usage::
     import click
     click.edit(filename='/etc/passwd')
 
+The editor session can be limited to a maximum duration by passing a
+``timeout`` in seconds. If the editor does not finish within that time,
+Click terminates it and raises :exc:`ClickException`.
+
+Example usage::
+
+    import click
+
+    try:
+        message = click.edit("Enter a message", timeout=10)
+    except click.ClickException as e:
+        click.echo(f"Editing timed out: {e}")
+
+.. versionadded:: 8.2
+
 
 Launching Applications
 ----------------------
